<!--
    Every user-visible string in the app. values-ru/strings.xml is the Russian
    twin and must carry the same keys; scripts/check-architecture.sh fails when a
    placeholder differs between the two.

    Placeholders are positional (%1$s). A bare %s renders literally.

    "Post" is the template's word for the thing people write. Rename it here
    (and in values-ru) to whatever your app calls it — the keys can stay.
-->
